#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:23
msgid ""
"The text import druid contains three panels but the middle panel differs "
"depending on the structuring system used, either with data fields separated "
"by a special character or with data fields occurring at equally spaced "
"intervals in each line. The first panel allows the user to configure the "
"character encoding, line break characters, structuring system, and line "
"range. The second panel allows the user to define the columns by either, for"
" separated data, setting the separating character and text delimiting "
"character, or, for fixed space data, by setting the column spacing. The "
"third panel allows the user to select which columns to import and define "
"their data types."
msgstr ""
"Textimportguiden består av tre paneler. Den mittersta panelen varierar "
"beroende på hur data är strukturerade: fält kan avgränsas med ett särskilt "
"tecken eller ligga med jämna mellanrum på varje rad. I den första panelen "
"ställer du in teckenkodning, radbrytningstecken, strukturmetod och "
"radintervall. I den andra definierar du kolumnerna: för avgränsade data "
"väljer du avgränsningstecken och tecken som omsluter textfält, och för data "
"med fast bredd anger du kolumnbredd. I den tredje väljer du vilka kolumner "
"som ska importeras och deras datatyper."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:38
msgid "The steps involved in the text import druid."
msgstr "Stegen i textimportguiden."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:45
msgid ""
"Launch the <interface>Text Import</interface> druid using, in the "
"<guimenu>File</guimenu>, the <guimenuitem>Open</guimenuitem> and selecting "
"the \"Text import (configurable)\" file format type."
msgstr ""
"Öppna guiden <interface>Textimport</interface> genom att gå till menyn "
"<guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu>, välja <guimenuitem>Öppna</guimenuitem> och sedan "
"välja filformatet ”Textimport (konfigurerbar)”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:53
msgid "Define the character encoding of the text block."
msgstr "Ange teckenkodningen för textblocket."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:58
msgid "Define the characters indicating the breaks between the lines."
msgstr "Ange tecknen som markerar radbrytningar."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:63
msgid "Select the line range from the text block to be imported."
msgstr "Välj vilka rader i textblocket som ska importeras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:68
msgid ""
"Go to the second panel, which will be different for data structured by "
"separating characters and data structured by fixed spacing."
msgstr ""
"Gå till den andra panelen. Den ser olika ut för data som avgränsas med "
"tecken och data med fasta avstånd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:75
msgid "(For separated data) Define the separating character."
msgstr "(För avgränsade data) Ange avgränsningstecknet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:80
msgid "(For separated data) Define the character grouping a text field."
msgstr "(För avgränsade data) Ange tecknet som omsluter textfält."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:85
msgid "(For fixed width data) Define the field widths."
msgstr "(För data med fast bredd) Ange fältens bredd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:90
msgid "Go to the third panel."
msgstr "Gå till den tredje panelen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:95
msgid "Configure the inclusion of empty outside columns."
msgstr "Välj om tomma kolumner utanför dataområdet ska tas med."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:100
msgid ""
"Select the locale that will influence the formatting of the numerical "
"elements in each column."
msgstr ""
"Välj de regionala inställningar som ska styra hur tal i varje kolumn "
"formateras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:106
msgid "Select the numerical formats for the data in each columns."
msgstr "Välj hur data i varje kolumn ska formateras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:111
msgid "Select the columns to be included in the imported block."
msgstr "Välj vilka kolumner som ska ingå i det importerade dataområdet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:116
msgid "Click on the <guibutton>Finish</guibutton> button."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen <guibutton>Slutför</guibutton>."
